      "text": "Got it \u2014 is this Dr. Jennifer, Cardiology's office at New York Baptist Hospital?",
      "timestamp": "16:56:20",
      "audio_rms": null
    },
    {
      "role": "caller",
      "text": "Yes, how can I help you now?",
      "timestamp": "16:56:28",
      "audio_rms": 0.02906673029065132
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Thanks \u2014 I just need to make sure I've got the right person before anything else. Can you confirm this is Dr. Jennifer, Cardiology, at New York Baptist Hospital, so I know I'm asking about the right doctor?",
